WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand in Mountain. Bend the right knee and hold the right ankle with the right hand.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Kick the right foot back and up as you hinge the torso slightly forward.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach the left arm forward for balance, or hold the foot with both hands if open.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lift the chest and gaze forward; keep the standing leg steady.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release with control and switch sides.
